<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Blount said downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Blount said downgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney downgraded Blount International Inc to outperform from buy, a Smith Barney source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3/8 to 37-3/4 in midmorning exchange trade.</p>
</text>
